sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Activity / Filament
    participant H as AdminPublicationHistory
    participant V as PublicationVersionService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GC as PublicationMediaCleanupService
    participant A as AdminAuditService
    participant N as AdminNotifier
    UI->>H: can_restore (nicht LIVE, Snapshot + kompatibler Schemahash)
    alt Gate verweigert
        H-->>UI: Warnung, keine Mutation
    else Restore erlaubt
        UI->>V: stageVersion(checkpoint, actor)
        V->>DB: BEGIN + Advisory Lock + Schema-Paritaet
        V->>V: assertRestorable; pendingCountAgainstCheckpoint
        V->>GC: queueAbandonedWorkingMedia
        V->>DB: Working leeren und Snapshot in RESTORE_TABLES-Reihenfolge laden
        V->>DB: Custom-Page-Bloecke historisch kanonisieren
        V->>DB: workingContext = restore + source checkpoint ID
        V->>A: publication.version_restored
        DB-->>V: COMMIT
        V->>GC: drain nach Commit
        V-->>UI: changed, checkpoint
        UI->>N: Version restored to working state (success)
        Note over UI,DB: LIVE bleibt bis zu einem eigenen Commit unveraendert
    end
